Version 4 of `mccli` uses new `Fortran` code for the Heart Failure model.  As explained more fully in the [User Guide](../doc/UserGuide), the older versions emited a bunch of human-friendly formatted files, which `mccli` processed using various `Python` programs.  The new `Fortran` model continues to emit all those files, and we continue to process them exactly as before, at least for now.  But the new code also emits 3 `.csv` files with all of the new and most of the old variables.  The code developed here adds the ability to cope with this to `mccli`.

